lt;",">":"&gt;",'"':"&quot;","'":"&#39;"}[c]));const LET = "ABCDE";const fmt = n => Number(n || 0).toLocaleString("en-IN");const sleep = ms => new Promise(r => setTimeout(r, ms));const store = {  get(k, d = null) { try { const v = localStorage.getItem(k); return v ? JSON.parse(v) : d; } catch { return d; } },  set(k, v) { try { localStorage.setItem(k, JSON.stringify(v)); } catch {} },  del(k) { try { localStorage.removeItem(k); } catch {} }};function toast(msg, ms = 2600) {  const t = document.createElement("div"); t.className = "toast"; t.textContent = msg;  document.body.appendChild(t); setTimeout(() => t.remove(), ms);}function shuffled(n) { const a = [...Array(n).keys()]; for (let i = n - 1; i > 0; i--) { const j = Math.floor(Math.random() * (i + 1)); [a[i], a[j]] = [a[j], a[i]]; } return a; }function loadScript(urls) {  return new Promise((res, rej) => {    const tryOne = i => {      if (i >= urls.length) return rej(new Error("Could not load library – check internet"));      const s = document.createElement("script"); s.src = urls[i]; s.onload = res; s.onerror = () => { s.remove(); tryOne(i + 1); };      document.head.appendChild(s);    };    tryOne(0);  });}const LIBS = {  xlsx: ["https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/xlsx/0.18.5/xlsx.full.min.js", "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/xlsx@0.18.5/dist/xlsx.full.min.js"],  qr: ["https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/qrcode-generator/1.4.4/qrcode.min.js", "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/qrcode-generator@1.4.4/qrcode.min.js"]};const ERR = {  QUIZ_NOT_FOUND: "No quiz found with this code. Check the code shown on the screen.",  NAME_TAKEN: "This name is already taken with a different PIN. Enter your original PIN, or use a different name.",  QUIZ_ENDED: "This quiz has ended.",  BAD_NAME: "Please enter your name (at least 2 letters).",  BAD_PIN_FORMAT: "PIN must be exactly 4 digits.",  BAD_PIN: "PIN does not match. Please rejoin.",  PLAYER_NOT_FOUND: "Your entry was not found (maybe removed by the host). Please join again.",  REMOVED: "You have been removed from this quiz by the host.",  QUIZ_NOT_LIVE: "The quiz is not running right now.",  RESTART_DISABLED: "The host has disabled restarting for this quiz.",  BAD_LOGIN: "Wrong username or password.",  TOO_MANY_ATTEMPTS: "Too many wrong attempts. Try again after 10 minutes.",  NOT_LOGGED_IN: "Please log in again.",  BAD_OLD_PASSWORD: "Current password is wrong.",  WEAK_PASSWORD: "New password must be at least 8 characters.",  HAS_PLAYERS: "Players have already joined this quiz. Reset the session first.",  QUESTION_CLOSED: "Time is up for this question.",  NO_LIFELINES: "No 50:50 lifelines left.",  ALREADY_ANSWERED: "You have already answered this question.",  FIFTY_NOT_POSSIBLE: "50:50 needs at least 3 options.",  JOIN_LOCKED: "The host has locked joining for this quiz.",  NOT_REVEALED: "Answer not revealed yet.",  BAD_QUESTION: "Question is incomplete (needs text, at least 2 options and a valid answer).",  NO_QUESTIONS: "No valid questions found in the file."};/* effective seconds for a question: host override for all, else per-question time from Excel, else no timer */const effTime = (settings, q) => { const t = settings?.timerAll; return (t !== null && t !== undefined && t !== "") ? (+t || 0) : (+(q && q.s) || 0); };const timerLabel = (settings, qs) => { const t = settings?.timerAll;  if (t !== null && t !== undefined && t !== "") return +t ? `${+t}s per question` : "No timer";  return "Time per question from Excel"; };const errText = e => ERR[e?.message] || e?.message || "Something went wrong";
/* ============================ backend ============================ */const CFG = window.QB_CONFIG || {};const LIVE = !!(CFG.SUPABASE_URL && CFG.SUPABASE_ANON_KEY);const DEMO = false;
